<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" integrity="sha256-8oGnlu0RheM0o/2j6kX7x3j9c1V1zA3yN7s9G1xQ==" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:wght@400;700&amp;family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 60px;
            background: #fff;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: #000;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-top: 5px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .date {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .columns {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .column {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .column h2 {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            border: 2px dashed #000;
            margin: 15px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            background: #f9f9f9;
        }

        .placeholder img-placeholder {
            width: 300px;
            height: 200px;
            background: #ddd;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 40px;
            text-align: right;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .signature-line {
            margin-top: 60px;
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            width: 200px;
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        .small {
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background: #f0f0f0;
        }

        .math {
            display: block;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="title">DOCUMENT TITLE</div>
        <div class="subtitle">Subtitle or Section Header</div>
    </div>

    <div class="date">July 31, 2026</div>

    <div class="columns">
        <!-- Left Column -->
        <div class="column">
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-title">Section 1: Introduction</div>
                <p>This is the first paragraph of the document. It contains some sample text to demonstrate the layout.</p>
                <p>Additional text goes here. The document uses multiple columns as seen in the original image.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-title">Section 2: Main Content</div>
                <p>Text continues in this column. Any unclear characters are marked with [?].</p>
                <div class="placeholder">[Chart: centered, 300x150]</div>
                <p>More text follows the placeholder.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column -->
        <div class="column">
            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-title">Section 3: Additional Details</div>
                <p>This column mirrors the original layout. Text is aligned to match the physical positioning in the source image.</p>
                <div class="placeholder">[Photo: right-aligned, 200x150]</div>
                <p>Final paragraph in this section.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <div class="section-title">Section 4: Conclusion</div>
                <p>The document ends with this conclusion. All text has been extracted verbatim.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="signature">
        <div class="signature-line"></div>
        <div>Author Name</div>
        <div class="small">Date: July 31, 2026</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
